*The crowd of 48,511 at the New Zealand vs Newcastle semi final broke the record for the highest attended rugby league match in New Zealand.
*Newcastle became the first side to go from a wooden spoon to a Grand Final the following year since [[2010 NRL season|2010]].
*The crowd of 80,814 for the Grand Final was the largest crowd Newcastle have played in front of since the [[2001 NRL Grand Final|2001 Grand Final]].
*Sydney became the first team to win the comp after conceding 50 points.

